{
  "manufacturer": "KROHNE",
  "manufacturer_slug": "krohne",
  "model": "MFC 300 Coriolis mass flow converter (Modbus RTU)",
  "model_slug": "mfc-300",
  "short_model": "MFC 300",
  "aliases": [
    "MFC300",
    "KROHNE MFC 300"
  ],
  "equipment_type": "Sensor (Coriolis mass flowmeter)",
  "applies_to": "MFC 300 converter with the Modbus option, supplementary instructions 4000744801 R01 (11/2009).",
  "summary": "The MFC 300 is a KROHNE signal converter for Coriolis mass flowmeters. With the Modbus option it is an RS-485 Modbus RTU slave. This map covers mass and volume flow, density, temperature, concentration and diagnosis floats, the double-float counters, counter and calibration parameters, serial settings and the control coils.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU"
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "unit_id": 1,
    "baud": 19200,
    "parity": "Even",
    "data_bits": 8,
    "stop_bits": 1,
    "tcp_port": null
  },
  "addressing": {
    "convention": "0-based",
    "note": "The manual lists protocol addresses that go into the request unchanged: input register 30006 is requested as start address 30006 (0x7536)."
  },
  "default_word_order": "ABCD",
  "firmware": "Electronic revision ER 3.3.xx (SW.REV. 3.3x), Modbus version 1.0.x",
  "source": {
    "title": "MFC 300 Supplementary instructions - Description of Modbus interface",
    "doc_number": "4000744801 R01",
    "revision_date": "2009-11",
    "url": "https://cdn.krohne.com/archive/AD_MFC300_Modbus_en_091124_4000744801_R01.pdf",
    "pages": "Serial settings p. 6; protocol and addressing pp. 8-9; coils pp. 10-11; input registers p. 12; holding registers pp. 13-16; calibration pp. 17-22"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Data format is selectable in converter menu C6.8; the default is Big Endian, which section 6.2 defines as MSB first, so floats and doubles are listed ABCD. The register table for 50004 pairs the labels the other way round (see below), so check one known value (for example 30000 at zero flow, or the baud rate at 50000) before trusting a new installation.",
    "Left out: the data-format register 50004, because its printed coding contradicts itself (0 = Little Endian 'MSB first', 1 = Big Endian 'LSB first'); set data format at the converter menu instead.",
    "Left out: long status sensor/device (30062 / 30064, byte[4]) because their bits are not defined here.",
    "Counter 3 and its parameters exist only on converters with the IO2 option; writing to a missing counter returns an error.",
    "Factory serial settings: address 1, 19200 baud, even parity, 1 stop bit."
  ],
